    {
      "text": "You can update details of tickets in the Zscaler Security Operations (SecOps) platform to ensure a clear and efficient remediation workflow."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Updating the Ticket Owner",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "To update the owner of a ticket:"
    },
    {
      "item": "In the SecOps platform, go to Vulnerabilities > Tickets.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          30,
          45
        ],
        [
          48,
          55
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "The Tickets page appears.",
      "depth": 0,
      "strong": [
        [
          4,
          11
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Click a ticket.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 2
    },
    {
      "item": "The ticket details drawer appears.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "On the Details tab, click the Owner drop-down menu and select an option.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          14
        ],
        [
          30,
          35
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Apply Changes.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 4,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          19
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Adding a Comment",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "You can use comments to update your team on changes made to a ticket, details on splitting findings from tickets, change of assignee, change of severity score, etc."
    },
    {
      "text": "To add a comment to a ticket:"
    },
    {
      "item": "In the SecOps platform, go to Vulnerabilities > Tickets.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          30,
          45
        ],
        [
          48,
          55
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "The Tickets page appears.",
      "depth": 0,
      "strong": [
        [
          4,
          11
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Click a ticket.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 2
    },
    {
      "item": "The ticket details drawer appears.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Click the Comments tab and add a comment.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          10,
          18
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Apply Changes.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 4,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          19
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Updating Ticket Status",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "A ticket's status reflects the current progress or state of the issue. This is essential for tracking workflows, communicating progress, and ensuring issues are addressed efficiently. To learn more, see Managing Ticket Statuses in UVM."
    },
    {
      "text": "To update the status of a ticket:"
    },
    {
      "item": "In the SecOps platform, go to Vulnerabilities > Tickets.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          30,
          45
        ],
        [
          48,
          55
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "The Tickets page appears.",
      "depth": 0,
      "strong": [
        [
          4,
          11
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Click a ticket.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 2
    },
    {
      "item": "The ticket details drawer appears.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Click the arrow next to the status progress bar at the top of the drawer.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 3
    },
    {
      "item": "Select the desired status.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 4
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Apply Changes.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 5,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          19
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Updating Tickets in Bulk",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "To apply changes to multiple tickets at the same time:"
    },
    {
      "item": "In the SecOps platform, go to Vulnerabilities > Tickets.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          30,
          45
        ],
        [
          48,
          55
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "The Tickets page appears.",
      "depth": 0,
      "strong": [
        [
          4,
          11
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Select the checkboxes of the tickets you want to update.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 2
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Update.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          12
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Select the options to update (e.g., Assignee, Severity, etc.).",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 4,
      "strong": [
        [
          36,
          44
        ],
        [
          46,
          54
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Save.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 5,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          10
        ]
      ]
    }
  ]
}
